, we can\u2019t thank you enough!&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><b>Ellen-Louise L.</b> &middot; Google review &middot; Kitchen</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"rvc\"><span class=\"st\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><blockquote>&ldquo;The guys at abj were able to create the perfect kitchen for us. &hellip; In terms of service, the quality of units &amp; quartz worktops &amp; kitchen fitting there is no comparison.&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><b>Sumeet O.</b> &middot; Google review &middot; Kitchen</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"rvc\"><span class=\"st\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><blockquote>&ldquo;We are very pleased with our new kitchen, everything from design, quotation and date of installation was carried out efficiently and promptly.&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><b>Kristina B.</b> &middot; Google review &middot; Kitchen</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n<!-- /ABJ ROOMREVIEWS -->\n", "wardrobes": "<!-- ABJ ROOMREVIEWS (3 real Google reviews matched to this room; 19 Nov 2026) -->\n<style>/* Undo: delete from the ABJ ROOMREVIEWS marker to /ABJ ROOMREVIEWS (section and style) and publish. */\n#kc .rvx{padding:clamp(48px,7vh,88px) 0;background:var(--lin2,#ECE5DA)}\n#kc .rvx .sh{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#kc .rvx h2{margin:12px 0 0}\n#kc .rvx .rvxg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(14px,1.6vw,24px);margin-top:clamp(22px,3vh,36px)}\n#kc .rvx .rvc{margin:0;padding:clamp(20px,2.2vw,28px);background:var(--lin,#F3EEE6);border-top:2px solid var(--go,#C9A96E);display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n#kc .rvx .st{color:var(--go,#C9A96E);letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:13px}\n#kc .rvx blockquote{margin:12px 0 16px;font:italic 400 clamp(17px,1.25vw,19px)/1.5 var(--serif);flex:1}\n#kc .rvx figcaption{font:500 11px/1.4 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.8}\n#kc .rvx figcaption b{font-weight:600}\n@media (max-width:760px){\n#kc .rvx{padding:40px 0}\n#kc .rvx .rvxg{display:flex;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scrollbar-width:none;margin-right:-20px;padding-right:20px;gap:12px}\n#kc .rvx .rvxg::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n#kc .rvx .rvc{flex:0 0 84%;scroll-snap-align:start}\n#kc .rvx blockquote{font-size:16.5px}\n}\n</style>\n<section class=\"rvx\" aria-label=\"Customer reviews\"><div class=\"w\"><div class=\"sh rv\"><div><span class=\"kick\">Google reviews</span><h2>What our wardrobe customers say</h2></div><a class=\"lnk\" href=\"https://share.google/wadbR4QCwRXxM5fcm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read all our Google reviews</a></div><div class=\"rvxg\"><figure class=\"rvc\"><span class=\"st\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><blockquote>&ldquo;They designed, manufactured and installed our fitted wardrobes, and we're delighted with the finished product. They listened to what we wanted and then came up with sensible suggestions to correct all the things we'd not considered.&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><b>Daniel</b> &middot; Google review &middot; Fitted wardrobes</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"rvc\"><span class=\"st\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><blockquote>&ldquo;ABJ recently completed a bedroom wardrobe install. It was complicated due to the rooms slanted ceilings. They did a fabulous job, we are so pleased with it.&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><b>James L.</b> &middot; Google review &middot; Sloping-ceiling wardrobes</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"rvc\"><span class=\"st\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><blockquote>&ldquo;Ordered 2 built in wardrobes and both were fitted installed and designed within 10 days all in house. &hellip; Very impressed amazing quality.&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><b>Tayyab A.</b> &middot; Google review &mi