ellent and a special shout out to the fitter Kestutis who worked so hard. &hellip; We are extremely happy with our new bedroom.&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><b>Anita W.</b> &middot; Google review &middot; Bedroom</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"rvc\"><span class=\"st\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><blockquote>&ldquo;The team designed and built bedroom furniture exactly the way we envisioned it. The highlight is the extendable bed \u2014 it\u2019s beautifully made, super practical, and saves so much room space.&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><b>Nelly A.</b> &middot; Google review &middot; Bedroom furniture</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"rvc\"><span class=\"st\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><blockquote>&ldquo;ABJ transformed our master bedroom with their sliding wardrobes. &hellip; Professional installation and they cleaned up perfectly afterward!&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><b>Ervins S.</b> &middot; Google review &middot; Master bedroom</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n<!-- /ABJ ROOMREVIEWS -->\n", "mediawalls": "<!-- ABJ ROOMREVIEWS (3 real Google reviews matched to this room; 19 Nov 2026) -->\n<style>/* Undo: delete from the ABJ ROOMREVIEWS marker to /ABJ ROOMREVIEWS (section and style) and publish. */\n#kc .rvx{padding:clamp(48px,7vh,88px) 0;background:var(--lin2,#ECE5DA)}\n#kc .rvx .sh{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#kc .rvx h2{margin:12px 0 0}\n#kc .rvx .rvxg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(14px,1.6vw,24px);margin-top:clamp(22px,3vh,36px)}\n#kc .rvx .rvc{margin:0;padding:clamp(20px,2.2vw,28px);background:var(--lin,#F3EEE6);border-top:2px solid var(--go,#C9A96E);display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n#kc .rvx .st{color:var(--go,#C9A96E);letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:13px}\n#kc .rvx blockquote{margin:12px 0 16px;font:italic 400 clamp(17px,1.25vw,19px)/1.5 var(--serif);flex:1}\n#kc .rvx figcaption{font:500 11px/1.4 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.8}\n#kc .rvx figcaption b{font-weight:600}\n@media (max-width:760px){\n#kc .rvx{padding:40px 0}\n#kc .rvx .rvxg{display:flex;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scrollbar-width:none;margin-right:-20px;padding-right:20px;gap:12px}\n#kc .rvx .rvxg::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n#kc .rvx .rvc{flex:0 0 84%;scroll-snap-align:start}\n#kc .rvx blockquote{font-size:16.5px}\n}\n</style>\n<section class=\"rvx\" aria-label=\"Customer reviews\"><div class=\"w\"><div class=\"sh rv\"><div><span class=\"kick\">Google reviews</span><h2>What our media wall customers say</h2></div><a class=\"lnk\" href=\"https://share.google/wadbR4QCwRXxM5fcm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read all our Google reviews</a></div><div class=\"rvxg\"><figure class=\"rvc\"><span class=\"st\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><blockquote>&ldquo;They came to measure the space beforehand and made the unit to fit perfectly, which made a huge difference. The quality is excellent and it fits in seamlessly with my room and d\u00e9cor.&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><b>Lana F.</b> &middot; Google review &middot; TV media unit</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"rvc\"><span class=\"st\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><blockquote>&ldquo;ABJ Kitchens &amp; Bedrooms recently installed a stunning bespoke TV media wall in our living room, and we couldn\u2019t be happier! The craftsmanship is top-notch, with hidden storage, LED lighting, and a sleek, modern design.&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><b>Arturas A.</b> &middot; Google review &middot; Media wall</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"rvc\"><span class=\"st\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><blockquote>&ldquo;ABJ Kitchens and Bedrooms Ltd designed and installed bespoke TV media units and two fitted wardrobes for us. The quality is excellent, prices were reasonable, and the whole process was smooth from start to finish.&rdquo;</blockquote><figcaption><b>Maksim M.</b> &middot; Google review &middot; TV units &amp; wardrobes</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n<!-- /ABJ ROOMREVIEWS -->\n"}
